gy":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"建安二十年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,997,"O175b"],"order":372},{"id":"wendi-e-o007d","title":"苏则平张进黄华叛乱","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o007d-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"苏则平张进黄华叛乱","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e42","label":"正文","text":"毌丘兴讨张进及叛胡","evidence":["wgc-q0186","wgc-q0011"]},{"id":"liusima-a-9cf28867f4599c2422e8","label":"正文","text":"张进执郡守举兵拒邹岐，黄华、麹演各逐故太守举兵应之","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"id":"liusima-a-9c3997a30d92c9dbd6bf","label":"正文","text":"张既进兵为苏则声势，则得以有功","evidence":["liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15"]},{"id":"rensu-a-2b6475c7ce31384a7228","label":"正文","text":"麹演复结旁郡为乱","evidence":["rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771"]},{"id":"rensu-a-60352d874d90ac8347a6","label":"正文","text":"张掖张进执太守杜通","evidence":["rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e"]},{"id":"rensu-a-123d169beda6fd401f54","label":"正文","text":"酒泉黄华不受太守辛机，进、华皆自称太守以应麹演","evidence":["rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae"]},{"id":"rensu-a-9ad7dda6263565f054c8","label":"正文","text":"武威太守毌丘兴告急于苏则","evidence":["rensu-q-e78f512255bb183010b0"]},{"id":"rensu-a-0159ae36fe1a06c5477a","label":"正文","text":"苏则见郡中大吏及郝昭等，与羌豪帅谋议因衅击贼、违诏专断","evidence":["rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c9594d7d6c490d9a51a8","label":"正文","text":"郝昭等从苏则之谋，发兵救武威，降其三种胡","evidence":["rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51"]},{"id":"rensu-a-ad538556a877165fe6f4","label":"正文","text":"苏则与毌丘兴击张进于张掖","evidence":["rensu-q-f9e1009ed308649c45ca"]},{"id":"rensu-a-4ae6b2011951f99b134e","label":"正文","text":"麹演将步骑三千迎苏则，辞来助军实欲为变，苏则诱而斩之，徇军，其党皆散走","evidence":["rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c841c2b338963c3b0645","label":"正文","text":"苏则与诸军围张掖破之，斩张进及其支党，众皆降","evidence":["rensu-q-131d2e9d4727bb8913d2"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c21a8a9b64d2d55eada7","label":"正文","text":"麹演军败后黄华惧，出所执乞降","evidence":["rensu-q-9ebd4335c7d1500f1afd"]},{"id":"rensu-a-3e269f40c17b23b4d05d","label":"正文","text":"河西平定，苏则还金城","evidence":["rensu-q-89f8773457ad9ed676b9"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9e