87dd1d287"]},{"id":"rensu-a-b5b6eb69149cdeb5c735","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"文帝令语：闻苏则又出军西定湟中，为河西作声势","evidence":["rensu-q-1deb67dbba4228bb801c"]},{"id":"rensu-a-3c81ee56edc9a7916e3f","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"张既答辞：金城昔为韩遂所见屠剥户不满五百，苏则到官内抚凋残、外鸠离散，今现户千余","evidence":["rensu-q-0cf05f92d4708205a1e0"]},{"id":"rensu-a-2a44f6d9e2e6a946f1e2","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"张既答辞：梁烧杂种羌昔与韩遂同恶、遂毙后越出障塞；苏则前后招怀，归就郡者三千余落","evidence":["rensu-q-e9fe3b81ca92b452e731"]},{"id":"rensu-a-48d679018b8907c4c8c1","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"张既答辞：西平麹演等倡造邪谋，苏则寻出军临其项领，演即归命送质，破绝贼粮","evidence":["rensu-q-1022c01121a0d0e69f41"]},{"id":"rensu-a-1bc3d2d781a7263cba22","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"张既答辞：苏则既有恤民之效又能和戎狄，若加爵邑诚足劝忠臣励风俗","evidence":["rensu-q-e5239f6008ca77124338"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"令问者","evidence":["rensu-q-2ce585223f687dd1d287"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"受问者；建言者","evidence":["rensu-q-2ce585223f687dd1d287","rensu-q-e5239f6008ca77124338"]},{"person":"wendi-p0010","role":"被议功加爵者；出军者；到官抚治者；招怀者；出军临讨者；所请加爵邑者","evidence":["rensu-q-2ce585223f687dd1d287","rensu-q-1deb67dbba4228bb801c","rensu-q-0cf05f92d4708205a1e0","rensu-q-e9fe3b81ca92b452e731","rensu-q-1022c01121a0d0e69f41","rensu-q-e5239f6008ca77124338"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"昔屠剥金城者","evidence":["rensu-q-0cf05f92d4708205a1e0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0342","role":"倡乱而归命送质者","evidence":["rensu-q-1022c01121a0d0e69f41"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-2ce585223f687dd1d287","rensu-q-1deb67dbba4228bb801c","rensu-q-0cf05f92d4708205a1e0","rensu-q-e9fe3b81ca92b452e731","rensu-q-1022c01121a0d0e69f41","rensu-q-e5239f6008ca77124338"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-2ce585223f687dd1d287","source_order":[16,62,12],"order":3403}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0342","name":"麴演","evidence":["wudi-q-o175","liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227","liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2","rensu-q-f75ff2373c553fc98b35","rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771","rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d","rensu-q-1022c01121a0d0e69f41"],"facts":[],"aliases":[{"text":"麹演","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o175-wudi-p0342","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o175"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47f53e7e482abd40535c","layer":"original","quote":"是时，武威颜俊、张掖和鸾、酒泉黄华、西平麹演等，并举郡反。自号“将军”，更相攻击","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-9d369236f45a972c5dfe","layer":"original","quote":"张掖张进执郡守，举兵拒岐；黄华、麹演各逐故太守，举兵以应之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-9455dc2ffaad43d41769","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47f53e7e482abd40535c","layer":"original","quote":"俊遣使送母及子，诣太祖为质，求助","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-9d369236f45a972c5dfe","layer":"original","quote":"既进兵，为护羌校尉苏则声势〖1〗，故则得以有功","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"恭即遣从弟华，攻酒泉沙头、乾齐二县〖14〗。恭又连兵，寻继华后，以为首尾之援","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"别遣铁骑二百，迎吏官属；东缘酒泉北塞，径出张掖北河，逢迎太守尹奉","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-6990f13f51360a8892b1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-70898cfcffa39d291237","layer":"original","quote":"时酒泉黄华、张掖张进，各据其郡，欲与恭（艾）并势","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":250,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-bbbf7e14283ba5da8cab","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"于是，张进须黄华之助〖16〗；华欲救进，西顾恭兵，恐急击其后，遂诣金城太守苏则降","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-0cf05f92d4708205a1e0","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-134322f702062bcfda6b","layer":"pei","quote":"金城郡，昔为韩遂所见屠剥，死丧流亡；或窜戎狄，或陷寇乱：户不满五百。则到官，内抚凋残，外鸠离散，今现户千余","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f97bee5ed11ae5ac93c4","start":104,"end":157,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-1022c01121a0d0e69f41","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-134322f702062bcfda6b","layer":"pei","quote":"西平麹演等，倡造邪谋，则寻出军，临其项领；演即归命送质，破绝贼粮","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f97bee5ed11ae5ac93c4","start":207,"end":239,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-131d2e9d4727bb8913d2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"则遂与诸军围张掖，破之；斩进及其支党，众皆降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":224,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-1deb67dbba4228bb801c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-134322f702062bcfda6b","layer":"pei","quote":"闻又出军西定湟中，为河西作声势","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f97bee5ed11ae5ac93c4","start":44,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-2ce585223f687dd1d287","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-134322f702062bcfda6b","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝令，问雍州刺史张既曰：‘试守金城太守苏则，既有绥民平夷之功，闻又出军西定湟中，为河西作声势，吾甚嘉之。则之功效，为可加爵邑未邪？封爵重事，故以问卿。密白意，且勿宣露也","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f97bee5ed11ae5ac93c4","start":12,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"张掖张进执太守杜通","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"后演复结旁郡为乱","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"演闻之，将步骑三千迎则；辞来助军〖8〗，而实欲为变。则诱与相见，因斩之；出以徇军〖9〗，其党皆散走","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":174,"end":223,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"于是昭等从之，乃发兵救武威；降其三种胡","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":146,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-89f8773457ad9ed676b9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"河西平，乃还金城","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":264,"end":272,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"则乃见郡中大吏及昭等〖3〗，与羌豪帅谋曰：“今贼虽盛，然皆新合；或有胁从，未必同心。因衅击之〖4〗，善恶必离；离而归我，我增而彼损矣。既获益众之实，且有倍气之势〖5〗；率以进讨，破之必矣。若待大军，旷日持久；善人无归，必合于恶；善恶既合，势难猝离。虽有诏命〖6〗，违而合权，专之可也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-9ebd4335c7d1500f1afd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"演军败，华惧，出所执乞降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":247,"end":259,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉黄华不受太守辛机〖1〗；进、华皆自称太守，以应之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e5239f6008ca77124338","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-134322f702062bcfda6b","layer":"pei","quote":"则既有恤民之效，又能和戎狄，尽忠效节。遭遇圣明，有功必录；若则加爵邑，诚足以劝忠臣，励风俗也","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f97bee5ed11ae5ac93c4","start":240,"end":286,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e78f512255bb183010b0","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"武威太守毌丘兴，告急于则","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e9fe3b81ca92b452e731","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-134322f702062bcfda6b","layer":"pei","quote":"又梁烧杂种羌，昔与遂同恶；遂毙之后，越出障塞。则前后招怀，归就郡者三千余落；皆恤以威恩，为官效用","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f97bee5ed11ae5ac93c4","start":158,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f75ff2373c553fc98b35","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-28b9b83f8a57b06d44a1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，西平麹演叛，称护羌校尉。则勒兵讨之；演恐，乞降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f9e1009ed308649c45ca","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"与兴击进于张掖","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":166,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o007d-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-aff500edc4a38bf656c0","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉黄华、张掖张进等各执太守以叛〖9〗。金城太守苏则讨进，斩之〖10〗。华降。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0011","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"毌丘俭字仲恭〖1〗，河东闻喜人也。父兴，黄初中为武威太守；伐叛柔服〖2〗，开通河右，名次金城太守苏则〖3〗。讨贼张进及讨叛胡有功，封高阳乡侯。﹝一﹞入为将作大匠。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0186","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"讨贼张进及讨叛胡有功","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o175b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-010b7223a46bf940739c","layer":"original","quote":"西平、金城诸将麴演、蒋石等，共斩送韩遂首。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o175","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-010b7223a46bf940739c","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，公自陈仓以出散关〖8〗，至河池〖9〗。氐王窦茂，众万余人，恃险不服。五月，公攻屠之。西平、金城诸将麴演、蒋石等，共斩送韩遂首。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
